    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Actions"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Actions give information about the operation that created the log. They go in a few categories."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "create: During resource creation"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "update: During resource update"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "delete: During resource depletion"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "change_owner: The ownership of the resource has changed. Currently, only CloudSigma staff can change ownership of a resource."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "clone_src: Resource is used as a cloning source"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "clone_dst: Resource is a cloning destination - the newly cloned drive."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "move: Drive is moved to another physical storage. Only staff members can move drives."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "convert_to_library: Drive is converted to a library drive. Only staff members can convert drives."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "converted_from_library: Drive is converted to a regular drive from a library drive. Only staff members can convert drives."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "init_upload: Drive upload is initialized."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "start_send: An attempt to start a server"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "boot: The result of a start operation."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "stop_send: An attempt to stop a server."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "stop: The result of a stop operation"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "open_vnc: Open VNC channel to a server"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "close_vnc: Close VNC channel to a server"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "shutdown_ACPI_send: An ACPI shutdown request is sent to the server."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "actions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "heal: The Server got healed because its recorded state did not match the physical infrastructure. For example, a server is marked as unavailable, but it is running fine."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "errors",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Errors"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "errors",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "If the field success is marked as False, that means that an error occurred during the operation. The error details are saved in the following fields:"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "errors",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "error_type - States the type of the error"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "errors",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "error_point - Points to the cause of the error and is mainly used for validation errors"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "errors",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "error_message - Human readable message associated with the error"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Example"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "The following example will show all the logged information during a server’s lifecycle."
    },
