    {
      "anchor": "example",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "If the server is fully booted and operational, its status will change to running. If it failed to boot for some reason, the error_type, error_point, and error_message fields will explain why that happened. In this particular case, we had a successful start, so the audit log looks like this:"
